# kind | name | source (on-disk LICENSE path for shards; for clib/runtime, an
# SPDX id of licenses-spdx/, or the path of the library's own license file)
#
# Only what the released binary actually embeds: the runtime shards of
# shard.yml (ameba and spectator are development dependencies that never end
# up in it), and the C libraries the stdlib modules apt-larder requires link.
#
# CONFIRMED on 2026-11-17 against the link line of this very binary, in the
# Alpine 3.24 image with Alpine's crystal 1.20.3 (the image of the Dockerfile,
# the same as the one crystalreleaser generates for the linux builds):
#   -lz -lssl -lcrypto -lyaml -lpcre2-8 -pthread -lgc -ldl  (+ musl, libgcc)
# Versions and licenses as apk records them in that image: openssl 3.5.9
# Apache-2.0, pcre2 10.49 BSD-3-Clause, yaml 0.2.5 MIT, zlib 1.4 Zlib, musl
# 1.2.6 MIT, gc 8.2.12 Boehm-GC. The darwin binaries link Homebrew's
# openssl@4 (4.1.0, Apache-2.0) statically, and libgc, pcre2 and libyaml
# from the compiler mise installs; zlib and libiconv come from macOS itself.
# Check the link line again when a stdlib module is added or the image moves.
#
# MIT, BSD-3-Clause and zlib require the copyright notice to be reproduced,
# and their SPDX text only has a blank there: those four libraries embed their
# own license file, taken from their sources at the versions above (the same
# files as crystalreleaser's, which links the same libraries):
#   pcre2    LICENCE.md  github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2  tag pcre2-10.49
#   libyaml  License     github.com/yaml/libyaml        tag 0.2.5
#   zlib     LICENSE     github.com/madler/zlib         tag v1.4
#   musl     COPYRIGHT   git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl    tag v1.2.6
shard   | admiral     | lib/admiral/LICENSE
shard   | crystal-env | lib/crystal-env/LICENSE
shard   | tallboy     | lib/tallboy/LICENSE
clib    | openssl     | Apache-2.0
clib    | pcre2       | licenses-upstream/pcre2.txt
clib    | libyaml     | licenses-upstream/libyaml.txt
clib    | zlib        | licenses-upstream/zlib.txt
clib    | boehm-gc    | Boehm-GC
clib    | musl        | licenses-upstream/musl.txt
clib    | libgcc      | GCC-runtime-exception
runtime | crystal     | Apache-2.0
project | apt-larder  | LICENSE
